{"title":"Fairy Dust","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Gossamer Knight, Glamourweaver</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"gossamer-knight\" title=\"Gossamer Knight - dropped it in 83 of 124 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f4c55c3eefcdac8bbb95.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gossamer Knight</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–11</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"glamourweaver\" title=\"Glamourweaver - dropped it in 21 of 35 looted corpses (1/1.7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab8e44715f741cfa1e45.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glamourweaver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1–11</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"fairy-dust\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/31b71b633f13ad01ed72.svg\" alt=\"Fairy Dust\"></div><h3>Fairy Dust</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/29/2026, 7:19:47 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}